Depends: rustyrig-server, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Browser-based client interface for the RustyRig server
 Static HTML, JavaScript, CSS, and supporting assets for accessing a
 RustyRig station from a web browser. This package installs the optional
 browser client separately from the RustyRig server.
